      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Analytics & learning loop\nDaily: fetches per-post metrics for posts 1-8 days old into **Metrics**.\nWeekly (INSIGHTS_WEEKDAY, 1 = Monday): Claude reads Log + Metrics + Clicks + Sales and writes **Insights**,\nwhich the autopilot's brief reads before writing the next posts.\n\n⚠️ Verify the Upload-Post analytics endpoint and query names in their API docs and adjust **Fetch analytics**.\nUntil then you can type numbers into the Metrics sheet by hand; the weekly review works either way.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
